  "title": {
    "rendered": "እንኳን ተወለዱ"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>እንኳን ደስ አልዎት እናታችን<br />\nእንኳን ተወለዱ<br />\nበደስታችን ከጎናችን ለነበራችሁ ለረዳችሁን ለምትረዱን ሁሉ አምላክ ዋጋችሁን ይክፈላችሁ።<br />\nእናታችን ቁስቋም አከባቢ ከቀዳማዊት እመቤት ጽ/ቤት በተሰጣቸው ሰፊ ግቢ ሥራቸውን አስፍተው ለመስራት ፍላጎት አላቸው አብሮ ለመስራትና እርሳቸውን ለማገዝ ለምትፈልጉ<br />\nስልክ 0911027171 ዘውዲቱ<br />\nየኢትዮጵያ ንግድ ባንክ<br />\n<span style=\"color: #00ccff;\">1000004338573</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday-2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-810\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday-2-300x223.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"223\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday-2-300x223.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday-2-160x120.jpg 160w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday-2-24x18.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday-2-36x27.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday-2-48x36.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday-2.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a> <a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday1-2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-811\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday1-2-300x218.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"218\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday1-2-300x218.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday1-2-24x17.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday1-2-36x26.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday1-2-48x35.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/80s-birthday1-2.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>እንኳን ደስ አልዎት እናታችን እንኳን ተወለዱ በደስታችን ከጎናችን ለነበራችሁ ለረዳችሁን ለምትረዱን ሁሉ አምላክ ዋጋችሁን ይክፈላችሁ። እናታችን ቁስቋም አከባቢ ከቀዳማዊት እመቤት ጽ/ቤት በተሰጣቸው ሰፊ ግቢ ሥራቸውን አስፍተው ለመስራት ፍላጎት አላቸው አብሮ ለመስራትና እርሳቸውን ለማገዝ ለምትፈልጉ ስልክ 0911027171 ዘውዲቱ የኢትዮጵያ ንግድ ባንክ 1000004338573</p>\n",
